# Reachability analysis module.
#
# The GIR-level dead function filtering is done inside format_gir.gg
# (format_module) rather than as a separate pass, because iterating
# through GIR instruction data via .get().unwrap() on Vector[GirFunction]
# causes CoW-related segfaults in the self-host runtime.
#
# The approach: imported functions (tracked in gmod.imported_fns) are
# filtered by checking if their mangled name is registered in fn_sigs.
# Same-file functions are always kept (matching the Rust --emit-gir
# behavior which emits all functions without DCE at GIR level).
